text":"Ogervorst","links":[]},{"name":"frname","value_wikitext":"Fore Givre","value_text":"Fore Givre","links":[]}],"start":25,"end":340}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"After breaking into [[Lok Lambert]]'s house through the window, [[Mr. MacTavish]] used Augerfrost to attack Lok and [[Sophie Casterwill]]. During the chase throughout Venice, Suits used the spell multiple times to attack them. {{source|A Seeker Is Born}}","text":"After breaking into Lok Lambert's house through the window, Mr. MacTavish used Augerfrost to attack Lok and Sophie Casterwill. During the chase throughout Venice, Suits used the spell multiple times to attack them. [A Seeker Is Born]"},{"heading":"Users","level":2,"wikitext":"* [[Casterwill Hunters]]\n* [[Dante Vale]]\n* [[DeFoe]]\n* [[Den Fears]]\n* [[Focauld Casterwill]]\n* [[Grier]]\n* [[Hoffman]]\n* [[Lok Lambert]]\n* [[Mermen]]\n* [[Marduk]]\n* [[Rassimov]]\n* [[Sophie Casterwill]]\n* [[Suits]]\n* [[Unnamed Orphan 002]]\n* [[Unnamed Orphan 003]]\n* [[Unnamed Orphan 004]]\n* [[Unnamed Orphan 005]]\n* [[Zhalia Moon]]","text":"• Casterwill Hunters\n• Dante Vale\n• DeFoe\n• Den Fears\n• Focauld Casterwill\n• Grier\n• Hoffman\n• Lok Lambert\n• Mermen\n• Marduk\n• Rassimov\n• Sophie Casterwill\n• Suits\n• Unnamed Orphan 002\n• Unnamed Orphan 003\n• Unnamed Orphan 004\n• Unnamed Orphan 005\n• Zhalia Moon"},{"heading":"Trivia","level":2,"wikitext":"*It is the first spell used in the show.\n*The first time [[Lok Lambert]] used the spell, it made his hand go numb. {{source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"• It is the first spell used in the show.\n• The first time Lok Lambert used the spell, it made his hand go numb. [Like Father, Unlike Son]"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\" widths=\"185\">\nS1E01 MacTavish Augerfrost.png|[[Mr. MacTavish]] using Augerfrost\n</gallery>","text":"Image caption: Mr. MacTavish using Augerfrost"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR =Fore-givre\n|DUT=Ogervorst}\n|POR=Bomba de gelo, Raio Congelante, Bolha de Frio, Frio Penetrante}}\n\n[[nl:Ogervorst]]\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]","text":"French: Fore-givre\nDutch: Ogervorst\nPortuguese: Bomba de gelo, Raio Congelante, Bolha de Frio, Frio Penetrante\n\nnl:Ogervorst"}],"full_text":"Augerfrost is an offensive spell mainly used by the Organization. It creates a sphere of blue, icy energy which can be fired with great force at an enemy. The spell is a staple of the Organization's Suits, though has also been used on several occasions by members of the Casterwill family, Huntik Foundation, and Blood Spiral.\n\nHistory\n\nAfter breaking into Lok Lambert's house through the window, Mr. MacTavish used Augerfrost to attack Lok and Sophie Casterwill. During the chase throughout Venice, Suits used the spell multiple times to attack them. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nUsers\n\n• Casterwill Hunters\n• Dante Vale\n• DeFoe\n• Den Fears\n• Focauld Casterwill\n• Grier\n• Hoffman\n• Lok Lambert\n• Mermen\n• Marduk\n• Rassimov\n• Sophie Casterwill\n• Suits\n• Unnamed Orphan 002\n• Unnamed Orphan 003\n• Unnamed Orphan 004\n• Unnamed Orphan 005\n• Zhalia Moon\n\nTrivia\n\n• It is the first spell used in the show.\n• The first time Lok Lambert used the spell, it made his hand go numb. [Like Father, Unlike Son]\n\nGallery\n\nImage caption: Mr. MacTavish using Augerfrost\n\nInternational Names\n\nFrench: Fore-givre\nDutch: Ogervorst\nPortuguese: Bomba de gelo, Raio Congelante, Bolha de Frio, Frio Penetrante\n\nnl:Ogervorst","raw_wikitext":"{{Stub|History details}}\n{{infobox spell\n| image = S1E23 Augerfrost.jpg\n| aura  = Blue\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[Blood Spiral]] members <br> [[Casterwill family]] <br> [[Huntik Foundation|Foundation]] members <br> [[The Organization|Organization]] members\n| first = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"\n| nlname = Ogervorst\n| frname = Fore Givre\n}}'''Augerfrost''' is an offensive spell mainly used by [[the Organization]]. It creates a sphere of blue, icy energy which can be fired with great force at an enemy. The spell is a staple of the Organization's [[Suits]], though has also been used on several occasions by members of the [[Casterwill family]], [[Huntik Foundation]], and [[Blood Spiral]].\n\n== History==\nAfter breaking into [[Lok Lambert]]'s house through the window, [[Mr. MacTavish]] used Augerfrost to attack Lok and [[Sophie Casterwill]]. During the chase throughout Venice, Suits used the spell multiple times to attack them. {{source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\n==Users==\n* [[Casterwill Hunters]]\n* [[Dante Vale]]\n* [[DeFoe]]\n* [[Den Fears]]\n* [[Focauld Casterwill]]\n* [[Grier]]\n* [[Hoffman]]\n* [[Lok Lambert]]\n* [[Mermen]]\n* [[Marduk]]\n* [[Rassimov]]\n* [[Sophie Casterwill]]\n* [[Suits]]\n* [[Unnamed Orphan 002]]\n* [[Unnamed Orphan 003]]\n* [[Unnamed Orphan 004]]\n* [[Unnamed Orphan 005]]\n* [[Zhalia Moon]]\n\n== Trivia ==\n*It is the first spell used in the show.\n*The first time [[Lok Lambert]] used the spell, it made his hand go numb. {{source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\" widths=\"185\">\nS1E01 MacTavish Augerfrost.png|[[Mr. MacTavish]] using Augerfrost\n</gallery>\n\n\n== International Names ==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR =Fore-givre\n|DUT=Ogervorst}\n|POR=Bomba de gelo, Raio Congelante, Bolha de Frio, Frio Penetrante}}\n\n[[nl:Ogervorst]]\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]","categories":["Article stubs","Blood Spiral magic","Blue-aura spells","Casterwill family magic","Huntik Foundation magic","Magic","Offensive spells","Organization magic"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:3288","status":"resolved","target_title":"Blood Spiral","label":"Blood Spiral","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_Spiral","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3288"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3280","status":"resolved","target_title":"Casterwill family","label":"Casterwill family","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_family","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3280"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1987","status":"resolved","target_title":"Huntik Foundation","label":"Foundation","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Huntik_Foundation","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1987"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2257","status":"resolved","target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3280","status":"resolved","target_title":"Casterwill family","label":"Casterwill family","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_family","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3280"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1987","status":"resolved","target_title":"Huntik Foundation","label":"Huntik Foundation","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Huntik_Foundation","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A